cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "r.dem: GRASS addon toolset for DEM co-registration, differencing, and topographic change analysis"
abstract: >-
  r.dem is a toolset of nine GRASS addon tools for topographic change
  analysis from pairs of digital elevation models, such as a post-event
  photogrammetric surface against a pre-event lidar reference. It covers
  co-registration (pseudo ground control points, Nuth and Kaab, and
  iterative closest point), systematic bias removal, DEM of difference
  computation with volumetric summary, level of detection, uncertainty
  propagation, and regional change screening.
type: software
